Tarka: search suggestions on by default (spec §7). ungoogled-chromium's
inox-patchset/0006-modify-default-prefs.patch turns kSearchSuggestEnabled off;
with Tarka as the default engine, suggestions come from api.gettarka.com,
which records nothing. M4 adds the rule that turns them off again when the
user picks another engine.

